[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9600.71, "timestamp": "02:40:00", "text": "很久以前，这件事就已经过去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.99, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "每次都是促销。他现在怎么样了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.15, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "现在？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9608.87, "timestamp": "02:40:08", "text": "他们现在情况如何？希望他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9633.03, "timestamp": "02:40:33", "text": "侦察"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9634.55, "timestamp": "02:40:34", "text": "大概就是这样，不管它是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9637.19, "timestamp": "02:40:37", "text": "因为这是逻辑上的长寿偏见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9641.429, "timestamp": "02:40:41", "text": "啊，是的。我的恐龙卡住了。那是"}]